flowchart LR
    V[Long Video] --> MBuild[Structured Segment Memory Builder]
    MBuild --> PMem[Persistent Video Memory\n60s segment granularity]
    Q[Question + Options] --> Retrieve[Question-aware Memory Retrieval]
    PMem --> Retrieve
    Retrieve --> Expand[Neighbor Expansion]
    Expand --> Tool[Temporal Re-observation Tool\nlocal frame sampling]
    Tool --> Final[Final Visual QA]
    Final --> Ans[Answer A/B/C/D]

    V -. uniform frames .-> U32[Uniform U32 / U64 Baseline]
    U32 --> Ans
